{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The game refers to the series of Meteor Butterfly , Naruto, Devil May Cry, God of War and other series, abandoning the traditional action game using rubbing moves and light and heavy attack intervals to control the way moves are triggered, and mainly expects to use unique combat mechanics to achieve more changes while lowering the threshold for getting started as much as possible. The combat system of this game is roughly divided into three directions - real-time combat system, semi-real-time combat system and delayed combat system, which correspond to the three classes of martial artist (not yet open), fighter and celestial master. This work is tentatively set for the realistic style of martial arts, and the gameplay refers to Meteor Butterfly , Naraka: Infinite, etc., to provide online battle functions, supplemented by different levels to tell the plot, and the final work forms an online service-oriented battle game based on gameplay innovation.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The game is mainly divided into two modes:1. The single-player mode offers stakes or other AI characters against each other, allowing players to familiarize themselves with their own operations. 2. LAN mode allows two players to play online against each other within a LAN.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855190?t=1752835996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855190?t=1752835996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855190/eb7ac41c66232bf6a9123372df85c457ce42d88d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752835996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855190/eb7ac41c66232bf6a9123372df85c457ce42d88d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752835996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The game refers to the series of Meteor Butterfly , Naruto, Devil May Cry, God of War and other series, abandoning the traditional action game using rubbing moves and light and heavy attack intervals to control the way moves are triggered, and mainly expects to use unique combat mechanics to achieve more changes while lowering the threshold for getting started as much as possible. The combat system of this game is roughly divided into three directions - real-time combat system, semi-real-time combat system and delayed combat system, which correspond to the three classes of martial artist (not yet open), fighter and celestial master. This work is tentatively set for the realistic style of martial arts, and the gameplay refers to Meteor Butterfly , Naraka: Infinite, etc., to provide online battle functions, supplemented by different levels to tell the plot, and the final work forms an online service-oriented battle game based on gameplay innovation.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The game is mainly divided into two modes:1. The single-player mode offers stakes or other AI characters against each other, allowing players to familiarize themselves with their own operations. 2. LAN mode allows two players to play online against each other within a LAN.</p>","developers":["\u68a6\u6e38\u793e"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855190/ca19b9482383c97167a71dae84e371c953961f20/header.jpg?t=1752835996","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movi